hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"193","Hiba ke bayan mein: Al-Abbas ibn al-Walid ibn Mazyad ne hum se bayan kiya, mere walid ne mujh se bayan kiya, Al-Awza'i se, unhon ne kaha: Al-Zuhri ne mujh se bayan kiya, Urwah se, Hazrat Aishah Raziallahu anha se, Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) se, ke Aap ne farmaya: Zindagi mein janaf karne wale ke sadqe mein se utna hi radd kiya jata hai jitna maut ke waqt janaf karne wale ki wasiyyat mein se radd kiya jata hai. Al-Abbas ne kaha: Unhon ne hum se ek martaba Urwah se bayan kiya, aur ek martaba Urwah se, Hazrat Aishah Raziallahu anha se, Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) se bayan kiya. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Ye hadith sahih nahin; is ka marfu hona sahih nahin."
"194","Sulayman ibn Dawud Al-Mahri ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Wahb ne humein khabar di; Yunus ibn Yazid aur Ibn Sam'an ne mujhe khabar di, Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne kaha: Zinda dene wale ki zindagi mein us ke janaf mein se utna hi radd kiya jata hai jitna mayyit ke us ke janaf mein se us ki wasiyyat mein us ki maut ke waqt radd kiya jata hai."
"195","Muhammad ibn Yahya Ibn Faris ne mujh se bayan kiya, Abd al-Razzaq ne mujh se bayan kiya, Ma'mar se, Al-Zuhri se, Urwah se, unhon ne kaha: Zinda dene wale ke janaf mein se utna hi radd kiya jata hai jitna mayyit ke janaf mein se us ki wasiyyat mein radd kiya jata hai. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Al-Hiql ne ise Al-Awza'i se, Al-Zuhri se, Urwah se, Hazrat Aishah Raziallahu anha se mauquf taur par riwayat kiya."
